							<a class="options btn btn-default btn-mini btn-xs" href="javascript:;" onclick="togglePostFold(event,1899218)" c>Unfold</a>
						<a class="title" href="javascript:;" onclick="togglePostFold(event,1899218)">Profound Authorial Commentary Time!</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djoric" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(388108); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=388108&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607071608" alt="Djoric" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=388108)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djoric" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(388108); return false;" >Djoric</a></span>, <span class="odate time_1385142086 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">22 Nov 2013 17:41</span>
